1
00:00:00,030 --> 00:00:01,270
Someone's knocking.

2
00:00:01,390 --> 00:00:03,609
But Wangdoo says the room is empty.

3
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:06,950
You came here to rescue an astronaut who went missing.

4
00:00:10,150 --> 00:00:11,419
This is Wangdoo.

5
00:00:11,599 --> 00:00:13,145
Your little AI guide.

6
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:18,625
But when you arrive, everyone is gone.

7
00:00:25,150 --> 00:00:27,675
His Scout Wing searches for signs of life.

8
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:33,568
But even Scout Wing can be wrong.

9
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:36,389
Your ship's camera.

10
00:00:36,569 --> 00:00:38,010
Someone is inside.

11
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:40,483
Wait.

12
00:00:40,603 --> 00:00:42,715
That's the astronaut you came to save.

13
00:00:50,100 --> 00:00:51,338
You go back for him.

14
00:00:54,150 --> 00:00:56,516
You can't save everyone and stop the ship.

15
00:00:56,636 --> 00:00:57,762
What do you do?

16
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:01,308
Comment A or B.

17
00:01:02,100 --> 00:01:04,084
Wangdoo can show you the clues.

18
00:01:04,264 --> 00:01:05,810
But the choice is yours.
